{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_02_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:cb39625ac2b518f880f37a765ea40ab99f5bc64258804ec8bd843cb40b241257",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:822d8b5e7f03a03461a896adf145e0dcfc718c8dbff4056ee53ad2158ed5d9dc",
      "text": "目标是Jupiter第一的万人迷！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a5860054c0237eafaa78c85642e0138ebf764862bb1cfde435307e233d8ea16",
      "text": "男极“受欢迎部门”的比赛舞台是电视\n节目《成为万物的万人迷！》。Jupiter只要在\n这里大显身手，315 Pro就能离男极KING更近一步。\n于是冬马为了成为组合内最受欢迎的\n男人，向Beit寻求了建议。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:822d8b5e7f03a03461a896adf145e0dcfc718c8dbff4056ee53ad2158ed5d9dc",
      "text": "目标是Jupiter第一的万人迷！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa56dcab2140547df5c06f5f347ca595edd7c1d30dbe41b49e0bb63fb9f325ad",
      "text": "啊——……怎么说呢，那件衣服挺好看的。\n所以，要不要跟我……唔……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09a81671b4d369f8c281cefa424f6578da26ed87cc995222ac167e2b1920e1f0",
      "text": "啊——！不行，耍帅耍得太生硬了！\n果然凭我还是赢不了北斗吗……！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f71d827b29b1c408d879c7ccb0be6b40a30a40db941f76d98566be7b6cab942f",
      "text": "（明明要在下次出演的电视节目《成为万物的万人迷！》里，\n去撩观众的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:340adff84d0f914cd9e9c2994a6fc19309172a63f18fca0100c0e0eae2e01fb7",
      "text": "（完全想不出好的台词，\n一点感觉都没有！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6328cd487769ac07eaa36555250ef8c0f7edc017293c89c98e8aab4783634a7",
      "text": "……听说节目的事前问卷里，大家都说\nJupiter里北斗绝对是第一名！来着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac4d8f7c84a3b09cd20e8bdedbe40400d838af333a2c1f68abe512dcc63b2e96",
      "text": "但是只要多练习，就算是我也肯定能超越北斗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4eb4ec8cacf2247e33ace28a27727c3b0ef704e2d8be24303135067a43119036",
      "text": "（……而且，这个节目\n是和男极联赛的“受欢迎部门”联动的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50e9e8f252303a8a934cf394d5c14ec625c5107849b913359b8b7b758c2a8ea1",
      "text": "（只要我们Jupiter表现优异，\n315 Pro就能更接近男极KING）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5455b60e9f627bd3b931fef091bb3dcc3fa429a55d1dd31b5c26f163edc5260",
      "text": "可不是犯怂的时候啊！但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01fbace4f3e2121d304cea0477a6347dcd50da959195749fb20b10a30ecf0ea3",
      "text": "撩人的话到底要怎么才能想出来啊？\n眼前要是能有个对象的话或许会不一样吧……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:679c9b58d71e310c4176189a333d191120842a895607fdbafa399f67e509c3cc",
      "text": "……对了，就用这个吧！！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
